{"id":"n48545768aa","headline":"The UK pension pot question: Why 2026-27 is the year to decide","summary":"From April 2027, UK pension pots will be subject to inheritance tax, prompting a reassessment of legacy planning. Indian holders of UK pensions are weighing transfers to QROPS before the deadline.","why":"Changes to inheritance tax on pensions alter the estate planning and tax liabilities of UK pension savers, and the rules are set by HM Revenue and Customs and UK government policy.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"London","country":"United Kingdom","lat":51.507,"lon":-0.128,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/banking/finance/the-uk-pension-pot-question-why-2026-27-is-the-year-to-decide/articleshow/133343797.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/banking/finance/the-uk-pension-pot-question-why-2026-27-is-the-year-to-decide/articleshow/133343797.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-08-19T11:05:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"6690d95ceb9cd82d","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-19T11:05:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-19T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-1013789.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"stevepb","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/wallet-cash-pocket-credit-card-1013789/"}}